<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Ragnarok Online - BRO/IRO/PRIVATE SERVER</Major>
    <Description>Macro created for auto farm on High Wizard only, at zenorcs, with storm gust lvl 3 on the right side of the map.

Steps to use:

1. Move your high wizard to the spot 199,261 on the map.
2. Insert your storm gust lvl 3 skill on key 1 and mana potion on 2. Put mouse pointer on top of your character.
3. Start the macro and have fun!

With this macro you can farm 24/7 without dying on this map.

Your high wizard will autopot while casting on mouse pointer.

This macro includes a randomizer on moveclick to bypass guepard anti cheat.

If you server has autoloot/P.autoloot/A.autoloot, just activate to farm some gold.

Any questions just pm me!
Roberto.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
